MATRIX: Trial division. Prints every prime below the limit and counts them.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE isprime WITH n
  IF n IS LESS THAN 2 THEN
    CASH OUT BETA
  PERIOD
  BUGATTI d EQUALS 2
  GRIND WHILE d TIMES d IS LESS THAN n PLUS 1
    IF n MODULO d IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
      CASH OUT BETA
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI d EQUALS d PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT SIGMA
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI limit EQUALS 50
BUGATTI n EQUALS 2
BUGATTI count EQUALS 0
BUGATTI line EQUALS ""

GRIND WHILE n IS LESS THAN limit
  IF CALL isprime WITH n THEN
    BUGATTI count EQUALS count PLUS 1
    IF line IS THE SAME AS "" THEN
      BUGATTI line EQUALS "" PLUS n
    OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
      BUGATTI line EQUALS line PLUS " " PLUS n
    PERIOD
  PERIOD
  BUGATTI n EQUALS n PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Primes below " PLUS limit
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI line
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Count: " PLUS count

BACK TO THE MATRIX
